{"ID":"20240220132618-iclwv38","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132618-iclwv38","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132618-iclwv38\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164306-mhsadm3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164306-hug5sfn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164306-hug5sfn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:108,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:108\u0026#125;","title":"【桂枝人参汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312164306-mhsadm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-mhsadm3","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百七十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-6pjowbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-6pjowbt","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」,外证未除,而数下之,遂协热下利,利下不止,心下痞鞕,表里不解者,「桂枝人参汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-jdkyle8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-jdkyle8","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"误下后有两种处方，用寒热来区分。如果误下后出现"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"热利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，张仲景是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葛芩连汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝人参汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，还有刚刚的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草泻心汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个甘草泻心汤和桂枝人参汤又差一截，桂枝人参汤里面寒的很重。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-4s1yz0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-4s1yz0d","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5——2"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-vkbwp6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-vkbwp6r","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝人参汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-1szv2js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-1szv2js","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝四两，甘草四两炙，白朮三两，人参三两，干姜三两切。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-pjzlugf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-pjzlugf","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味,以水九升,先煮四味,取五升,纳桂更煮,去滓,取三升,温服一升,日再服,夜一服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-z1cbevf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-z1cbevf","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人参出现的时候一定是津液受到伤害"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，病人比较贫苦，可以用党参代替人参，没有关系。所以小柴胡汤里常常有人参，我们常用党参来取代人参。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-04to0qr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-04to0qr","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人有寒利的时候津液一定会伤到，我们用人参去补丧失的津液。白术能够去湿，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术去湿，是去关节上的湿，所以张仲景在处理风湿关节炎的时候，会用白术，还有肠胃里面的湿，因为白术是健脾的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，市面上有生白术，有黄土炒的白术。如果下痢的很厉害，白术用赤石脂炒一下，赤石脂本来涩剂，这个很凶，一下就止掉了。健脾选黄土炒的白术就可以。寒利桂枝能够行阳，能够让心脏的力量加强。心脏会移热到小肠，肺法像天，它能把热往下降，降到小肠里面去，所以小肠跟心脏同样是属火，如果寒利的时候，小肠的火没了，所以用桂枝，再严重的话用到炮附子都可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-3d0eway","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-3d0eway","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水先煮四味药，桂枝最后再煮，不要煮那么久。温服一升,日再服,夜一服。每六小时喝一次，晚上再吃一次，治疗肠胃的，让肠胃的功能恢复的很快，一天吃四次。半夜让病人再起来吃。这是服药方法。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-pcc256y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-pcc256y","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要就是这个病人外证未除，所以我们会用到桂枝，一个原因就是桂枝能让心火进到小肠，第二个因为桂枝还有一点外证。桂枝汤症还有，所以用桂枝发一下表。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-zysq5zn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-zysq5zn","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干姜和生姜不一样，如果是热利的话，病人有恶心，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用生姜。干姜用在寒痢。炙甘草有寒症的时候才会出现"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-fe3u9ba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-fe3u9ba","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"什么时候用桂枝人参汤，当他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有太阳表症的时候，兼有寒痢下痢的时候，使用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164306-hug5sfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164306-hug5sfn","updated":"20240312164306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么区分他是寒症热症，热症下痢病人口渴，因为津液伤到，舌头是黄的，寒痢的时候舌苔是白的，病人不渴，下痢出来可以看到清谷，水，都是清水，食物都可以看到，热利的话食物消化掉了，排出来很臭，因为里面有肠胃炎，有发炎的现象。"}]}]}